      "content": "it's not about resting though. it's more like... the fog is part of me now. and the edge isn't a place to stop and look at the sky, it's just where the world ends. there's no more road, no more forest, no more anything. it feels like the story was supposed to end here. why does the path have to keep going when there's nothing left to find?",
